WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.630
Urartu, Biainili to its kings,

2
00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.470
ruled these highlands
from Tushpa, by Lake Van.

3
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.940
Its citadel crowned the Rock of Van,

4
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:15.214
a long, narrow ridge
that rises steeply from the plain.

5
00:00:15.574 --> 00:00:18.364
By the middle
of the eighth century BC,

6
00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:20.937
Sarduri II held the throne.

7
00:00:21.298 --> 00:00:25.096
Then Tiglath-pileser III
took the Assyrian throne.

8
00:00:25.136 --> 00:00:28.706
In 743 BC, by the Euphrates,

9
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:30.546
he broke Sarduri.

10
00:00:30.871 --> 00:00:34.641
Eight years later, in 735 BC,

11
00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:37.356
he marched
into the heart of Biainili.

12
00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:40.666
His inscriptions say
he shut Sarduri up in Tushpa

13
00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:43.707
and defeated him
before the city gates.

14
00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.837
Yet they do not claim
that the citadel fell,

15
00:00:46.877 --> 00:00:48.677
and it did not.

16
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.677
Now Assyrian spears
fill the vale below the rock.

17
00:00:53.037 --> 00:00:55.521
Hold the royal road.

